OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boelo hits UK with wind and
OL,4,Arain as warnings issued for large parts
OL,5,Aof country
OL,6,
OL,7,FFerry services in the Irish Sea are
OL,8,Fcancelled, and there are also
OL,9,Fcancellations on the CalMac service
OL,10,Faround the west coast of Scotland
OL,12,FMeanwhile, a marathon in the Eryri
OL,13,Fnational park in north Wales has been
OL,14,Fcancelled
OL,16,FTens of thousands of properties lost
OL,17,Fpower in south-west England on Friday -
OL,18,Fthousands are still waiting to be
OL,19,Freconnected
